-- 4 → 5: what another device is still doing shows up in this device's list (docs/03 "다른 기기의 녹음").
--
-- The whole schema lives in `Rec.sq`; a migration is only the difference from the version it is
-- named after. The two have to agree, and `MigrationTest` — which builds an old database by hand
-- and upgrades it — is what says they do.
--
-- Never edit a migration once it has run anywhere: add the next one (docs/10 "스키마 마이그레이션").
--
-- Every row already here reads back with no marker, which is exactly what "nothing is pending" is:
-- the next pull fills the column in from the folders' `pending` appProperty, and a row of this
-- device's own never gets one at all.
ALTER TABLE recording ADD COLUMN remote_pending TEXT;
